{"role":"assistant","content":"Документация по scopes на форуме 2021 года упоминает CALENDAR, но проверю актуальный список scope — возможно, названия изменились:","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_asOiP204rBeCe57UhjrRapig","function":{"name":"WebSearch","arguments":"{\"query\":\"\\\"intervals.icu\\\" oauth scope \\\"CALENDAR:READ\\\" OR \\\"CALENDAR:WRITE\\\" authorize\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"tool_N5r2TgXSFCIToqGjxkfdsvIH","function":{"name":"WebSearch","arguments":"{\"query\":\"intervals.icu developer docs \\\"scopes\\\" \\\"planned workouts\\\" OAuth app settings\"}"}}]}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_asOiP204rBeCe57UhjrRapig","content":"Title: inspectIntervalsPermissions 回報的是發證當下的紀錄，不是 provider 現在認不認\nSite: Github\nDate: 2026-08-18\nURL: https://github.com/atomchung/long-run-hybrid-coach/issues/162\nSnippet: CALENDAR:WRITE carries calendar read access there, so a separate ... intervals.icu/t/intervals-icu-oauth-support/2759. 所以 CALENDAR ...\n\n---\n\nTitle: OAuth 2.0 Scope Aggregation for Multi-Step AI Agent Workflows\nSite: sjtu.edu.cn\nDate: 2026-02-10\nURL: https://ftp.sjtu.edu.cn/sites/ftp.ietf.org/internet-drafts/draft-jia-oauth-scope-aggregation-00.html\nSnippet: 4. Workflow Execution with OAuth Scope Aggregation Using the security member in the resource metadata, an AI agent can follow the sequence below to execute a workflow: ¶ 1. Resource Discovery: The AI agent fetches the resource metadata from the resource server. Resource metadata MAY include a security member describing the required authentication scheme, scopes, and AS metadata URL. ¶ 2. Authorization Domain Identification: Given a pre-defined or planned workflow, the AI agent iterates through e\n\n---\n\nTitle: kuranov/intervals-icu-tools\nSite: Github\nDate: 2024-01-01\nURL: https://github.com/kuranov/intervals-icu-tools\nSnippet: ... intervals.icu/oauth/authorize'); authUrl.searchParams.set('client_id ... CALENDAR:READ , CALENDAR:WRITE; SETTINGS:READ. Working with workout library.\n\n---\n\nTitle: Issues with Microsoft Graph API OAuth Scope Handling - Microsoft Q&A\nSite: Microsoft Learn\nDate: 2025-06-26\nURL: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-sg/answers/questions/2287394/issues-with-microsoft-graph-api-oauth-scope-handli\nSnippet: Current Implementation Details When a user connects an Outlook integration, we generate an authorization URL with specific scopes based on the integration type: For Outlook Mail: ```lang-yaml curl -X GET \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/common/oauth2/v2.0/authorize ?client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID &response_type=code &redirect_uri=https://your-app.com/mail/callback &response_mode=query &scope=User.Read Mail.Read Mail.ReadWrite Mail.Send &prompt=consent\" ``` For Outlook Calendar: ```lang-yaml curl -X \n\n---\n\nTitle: 命令行驱动办公自动化：基于开源工具的效率提升实践\nSite: 百度AI云\nDate: 2026-10-10\nURL: http://intl.cloud.baidu.com/zh/article/9159164\nSnippet: 3. 权限体系配置 现代办公系统采用OAuth2.0授权机制，需完成三步配置： 1. 应用创建：在管理后台注册自动化应用，获取App ID/Secret 2. 权限声明：明确申请文档读取、日程管理等API访问权限 3. 用户授权：生成授权链接引导管理员完成最终确认 智能编程工具可简化该流程： ```lang-bash 启动授权向导cli auth init# 自动生成授权链接（示例输出）Please visit: https://oauth.example.com/authorize?client_id=xxx&scope=document.read,calendar.write# 完成授权后输入验证码Enter authorization code: abc123 ``` 三、典型自动化场景实现 1. 批量文档处理 场\n\n---\n\nTitle: Domestique - a free, open source, science based cycling training app - AI Tools - Intervals.icu Forum\nSite: Intervals.icu Forum\nDate: 2026-07-03\nURL: https://forum.intervals.icu/t/domestique-a-free-open-source-science-based-cycling-training-app/130388?page=3\nSnippet: post by eMadman on 3 Jul eMadman's profile Trying to reconnect to Intervals.icu is throwing an error: image post by Domestique on 3 Jul Domestique's profile - Fixed connecting (or reconnecting) to intervals.icu failing with a “Duplicate scope CALENDAR” error — introduced in v3.0.1 alongside the new calendar push. If v3.0.1 showed you that error, just update and connect again. Root cause: intervals.icu allows one scope per area. v3.0.1’s OAuth request sent both `CALENDAR:READ` and `CALENDAR:WRITE\n\n---\n\nTitle: Integrate Google Calendar API into Your Web App with Ease\nSite: QalbIT\nDate: 2026-04-15\nURL: https://qalbit.com/blog/how-to-integrate-the-google-calendar-api-into-your-web-application/\nSnippet: What is Google Calendar API? Millions of people use Google Calendar to track their events. The Calendar API lets you integrate your app with Google Calendar, creating new ways for you to engage your users. Steps to integrate Google calendar: 1. Authorize your application to read and write events. Firstly you have to authorize your web application to read and write events on behalf of yours. Every request your application sends to the Google Calendar API must include an authorization token. The A\n\n---\n\nTitle: TrainerDay API\nDate: 2026-01-01\nURL: https://api.trainerday.com/\nSnippet: OAuth 2.0 for Third-Party Apps For organizations Do you have a training app or platform that's already live? We offer OAuth 2.0 integration so your users can connect their TrainerDay accounts. Contact us to get started. Register Your Application Contact us at trainerday.com/contact-us to apply for access to receive a `client_id` and `client_secret`. Redirect User to Authorize GEThttps://api.trainerday.com/oauth/authorize? client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID& response_type=code& redirect_uri=https://yourapp\n\n---\n\nTitle: Feishu Cli Auth (Grade A) - Claude Skill\nSite: Claude Skill\nDate: 2026-11-06\nURL: https://www.skillsdirectory.com/skills/leoyeai-feishu-cli-auth\nSnippet: Security analysis ``` --- name: feishu-cli-auth description: >- 飞书 OAuth 认证和 User Access Token 管理。两步式非交互登录（AI Agent 专用）、 Token 状态检查、scope 配置、自动刷新机制、搜索功能的 Token 依赖关系。 当用户请求\"登录飞书\"、\"获取 Token\"、\"OAuth 授权\"、\"auth login\"、\"认证\"、 \"搜索需要什么权限\"、\"Token 过期了\"、\"刷新 Token\"时使用。 当遇到权限错误（如 99991679 Unauthorized）、Token 过期、state 不匹配等问题时也应使用此技能。 也适用于：搜索命令报权限错误、Token 相关的排错、需要判断当前授权状态的场景。 当其他飞书技能（toolkit/msg/read 等）遇到 User Access Token 相关问题时，也应参\n\n---\n\nTitle: Mockoon - Mock sample for your project: SalesLoft Platform API\nSite: mockoon.com\nURL: https://mockoon.com/mock-samples/salesloftcom/\nSnippet: Drchrono.com drchrono.com This document is intended as a detailed reference for the precise behavior of the drchrono API. If this is your first time using the API, start with our tutorial. If you are upgrading from a previous version, take a look at the changelog section. Authorization Initial authorization There are three main steps in the OAuth 2.0 authentication workflow: Redirect the provider to the authorization page. The provider authorizes your application and is redirected back to your w\n\n---\n\nTitle: Mockoon - Customer relation APIs mock samples for your project\nSite: mockoon.com\nURL: https://mockoon.com/mock-samples/category/customer-relation/\nSnippet: Drchrono.com drchrono.com This document is intended as a detailed reference for the precise behavior of the drchrono API. If this is your first time using the API, start with our tutorial. If you are upgrading from a previous version, take a look at the changelog section. Authorization Initial authorization There are three main steps in the OAuth 2.0 authentication workflow: Redirect the provider to the authorization page. The provider authorizes your application and is redirected back to your w\n\nWhen you rely on a result in your answer, cite it inline as a markdown link, e.g. [title](url)."}
